  "question": {
    "text": "Two planets $\\mathrm{A}$ and $\\mathrm{B}$ have the same material density. If the radius of $\\mathrm{A}$ is twice that of $\\mathrm{B}$, then the ratio of the escape velocity $\\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{A}} / \\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{B}}$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
