  "solution": {
    "text": "$v_{e}=\\sqrt{2 g R}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2 G M}{R^{2}}} R=\\sqrt{\\frac{2 G d \\frac{4}{3} \\pi R^{3}}{R^{2}}} R$\n$=\\mathrm{R} \\sqrt{2 \\mathrm{Gd} \\frac{4}{3} \\pi}$\nas $v_{e} \\propto R$ for same density, $\\frac{v_{A}}{v_{B}}=2$",
